Further support comes from looking at the following approximate form for the running of the gauge coupling. We assume the hierarchy $\Lambda^{2}\ll m^2\ll M^{2}_{\textrm{NC}}$, $$\begin{aligned}
\label{run1}
&&\!\!\!\!\!\frac{4\pi^2}{g^2_{\textrm{U(1)}}}=b^{\textrm{p}}_{0}\log\left(\frac{k^2}{\Lambda^2}\right),
