The continuity conditions

$${\bf n}\times \lbrack {\bf E}_{in}({\bf r}^{<})-{\bf E}({\bf r}
^{>})]=0,\,\,\,\,\,\,{\bf n}\times \lbrack {\bf H}_{in}({\bf r}^{<})-{\bf H}(
